.TH geectl-local-build-spec-cleaner 1  "geectl-local-build-spec-cleaner 0.2.2" 
.SH NAME
geectl\-local\-build\-spec\-cleaner \- Run `spec\-cleaner` on a spec in the container
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBgeectl local\-build spec\-cleaner\fR [\fB\-\-timeout\-secs\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIDIRECTORY\fR> <\fISPEC\fR> [\fIARGS\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Run `spec\-cleaner` on a spec in the container
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-timeout\-secs\fR \fI<TIMEOUT_SECS>\fR [default: 3600]
Timeout in seconds for the run
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fIDIRECTORY\fR>
The source directory carrying the spec
.TP
<\fISPEC\fR>
The spec file, inside the source directory
.TP
[\fIARGS\fR]
Extra arguments for `spec\-cleaner`, after `\-\-`
.SH VERSION
v0.2.2
